  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the Capacity of IOM Staff Members and Partners to Promote Policy Liaison Alongside Protection Interventions in Light of the Institutional Reform in the MENA region along the CMR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with IOM&apos;s Strategic Vision of 2019, and its Protection Strategic Framework (6 pillar approach), as well as the IOM Middle East and North Africa Regional Strategy 2020-2024, the project will contribute to strengthening protection and harmonizing protection work- and data- through policy in IOM interventions pertinent to mobility, resilience and governance, by strengthening inter alia: institutional identity; inter-agency and international cooperation; migration mainstreaming into UN Frameworks; preparation for the second round of Global Compact on Migration Regional Reviews; data, research and knowledge management; and field staff development.</narrative>
  </description>
